WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:09.070
Saved messages: ready texts that you and your team send in a chat with one click; flows and automations can use them too.

2
00:00:09.624 --> 00:00:15.180
Click "New saved message", give it a short name and write the text in your languages.

3
00:00:15.731 --> 00:00:19.930
In a chat, pick the saved message from beside the typing box.

4
00:00:20.480 --> 00:00:26.820
To change a text, open its box and press "Edit"; every place that uses it is updated.

5
00:00:27.371 --> 00:00:34.520
Don't repeat prices in a saved message; keep prices in "Content & pricing" so they change in one place.
